00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:00,188
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:00:00,188 --> 00:00:01,388
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

2
00:00:01,388 --> 00:00:02,528
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

3
00:00:02,528 --> 00:00:03,658
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

4
00:00:05,098 --> 00:00:07,028
(Episode 14)

5
00:00:08,528 --> 00:00:09,998
What kind of life have you lived?

6
00:00:19,708 --> 00:00:21,148
For the eight years since you left me,

7
00:00:22,708 --> 00:00:24,278
what kind of life have you lived?

8
00:00:30,848 --> 00:00:31,858
Gyu Rim.

9
00:00:34,488 --> 00:00:35,688
You'll wake Gyeol.

10
00:00:36,458 --> 00:00:37,858
Please close the door.

11
00:01:52,268 --> 00:01:53,438
What happened?

12
00:01:53,838 --> 00:01:57,708
How badly was he beaten that my Sung Wook needs surgery?

13
00:01:58,338 --> 00:02:00,538
- He lost several teeth. - And?

14
00:02:00,608 --> 00:02:02,578
The surgery's because he tore his cartilage when he fell.

15
00:02:02,648 --> 00:02:05,378
Who was it? Who did this to my son?

16
00:02:06,648 --> 00:02:08,288
What, did he run into some gangsters?

17
00:02:09,388 --> 00:02:10,618
It wasn't gangsters, just one person.

18
00:02:10,688 --> 00:02:12,518
I mean, he was beaten up by one guy.

19
00:02:13,688 --> 00:02:14,988
I don't know him.

20
00:02:15,388 --> 00:02:18,198
He said he's one of Sung Wook's seniors who knows him well.

21
00:02:18,798 --> 00:02:21,528
- What? - Oh, my gosh.

22
00:02:21,598 --> 00:02:24,898
Oh, my goodness.

23
00:02:25,468 --> 00:02:26,538
Get up.

24
00:02:28,208 --> 00:02:31,408
Our wedding is only one week away. What do I do, Mother?

25
00:02:36,778 --> 00:02:40,218
I used to do a bit of boxing when I was younger.

26
00:02:41,288 --> 00:02:44,448
Usually, 1 punch would knock out 3 teeth.

27
00:02:45,988 --> 00:02:48,388
Did he really lose six teeth?

28
00:02:49,728 --> 00:02:50,728
If you're...

29
00:02:51,398 --> 00:02:54,498
someone with such a strong punch, you should have held back even more.

30
00:02:54,798 --> 00:02:56,028
You said he's a close acquaintance,

31
00:02:56,228 --> 00:02:59,098
so how could you beat him so mercilessly?

32
00:03:00,238 --> 00:03:02,208
I wasn't beating up a person.

33
00:03:02,538 --> 00:03:04,108
I was beating up an animal.

34
00:03:05,008 --> 00:03:06,008
What?

35
00:03:19,258 --> 00:03:21,188
Gosh, you're not asleep?

36
00:03:21,188 --> 00:03:22,228
Since when...

37
00:03:23,458 --> 00:03:24,828
have you been sitting there like that?

38
00:03:26,898 --> 00:03:28,468
It's okay. It's not a big deal.

39
00:03:29,198 --> 00:03:32,368
Doesn't everyone have a birth secret?

40
00:03:37,338 --> 00:03:40,838
My dad is 160cm tall, and though I've never asked,

41
00:03:40,908 --> 00:03:44,008
it's possible he might not be my real father, you know.

42
00:03:47,048 --> 00:03:48,948
Did you meet with the Chairman?

43
00:03:50,688 --> 00:03:52,058
Did he go all, "I am your father?"

44
00:03:52,118 --> 00:03:54,958
Did he tell you to call him Dad from now on?

45
00:03:56,158 --> 00:03:57,358
Wait a minute.

46
00:03:57,788 --> 00:03:59,828
Come to think of it, how come in your family...

47
00:03:59,928 --> 00:04:02,228
there's a birth secret in every generation?

48
00:04:02,398 --> 00:04:03,668
It's the same with Han Gyeol.

49
00:04:04,498 --> 00:04:06,298
You're just choosing to ignore it.

50
00:04:06,438 --> 00:04:09,138
Han Gyeol is also under suspicion of being your son.

51
00:04:09,208 --> 00:04:10,608
Can you please be quiet?

52
00:04:12,608 --> 00:04:14,948
I thought this stuff only happened in dramas,

53
00:04:14,948 --> 00:04:16,978
but I didn't know birth secrets were this common.

54
00:04:17,048 --> 00:04:19,048
I told you to shut up, you bastard.

55
00:04:19,778 --> 00:04:21,488
"Shut up, you bastard."

56
00:04:50,548 --> 00:04:53,078
If there's anything I can do to help...

57
00:04:57,648 --> 00:04:59,188
Help? My foot.

58
00:05:01,118 --> 00:05:03,328
What could you possibly do to help, Kim Mu Jin?

59
00:05:30,088 --> 00:05:32,058
You can just tell me the truth.

60
00:05:33,488 --> 00:05:35,628
The truth about what?

61
00:05:36,128 --> 00:05:37,658
I'm telling you, I really don't know.

62
00:05:38,558 --> 00:05:39,758
I was away on business, and when I came back,

63
00:05:39,828 --> 00:05:41,328
you had already been born.

64
00:05:41,868 --> 00:05:44,328
They told me the day before was your 100-day celebration.

65
00:05:44,528 --> 00:05:46,198
I even ate the ceremonial rice cakes.

66
00:05:46,738 --> 00:05:50,938
Your daughter was having a baby, so why weren't you at home, Grandpa?

67
00:05:51,168 --> 00:05:52,978
I was out earning money.

68
00:05:53,378 --> 00:05:56,608
Hey, and it's not like your mom asked me...

69
00:05:56,678 --> 00:05:58,478
for permission to have you, did she?

70
00:05:59,348 --> 00:06:03,188
Hey, I have plenty to be frustrated and upset about too.

71
00:06:03,788 --> 00:06:05,258
At my age and with my looks,

72
00:06:05,688 --> 00:06:08,358
I have to hear people call me Grandpa because of you.

73
00:06:10,988 --> 00:06:12,758
You don't like me, do you, Grandpa?

74
00:06:14,868 --> 00:06:18,068
I didn't at first. My stomach.

75
00:06:19,298 --> 00:06:20,498
But what can I do?

76
00:06:21,098 --> 00:06:22,868
You're my own flesh and blood.

77
00:06:23,868 --> 00:06:26,778
If I weren't your flesh and blood with your blood in me,

78
00:06:26,938 --> 00:06:28,178
you'd hate me, right?

79
00:06:28,448 --> 00:06:30,948
What are you talking about? It's the crack of dawn.

80
00:06:31,408 --> 00:06:32,848
Get out. You. Get out of here now.

81
00:06:32,948 --> 00:06:35,288
I can't strain with you in here, you punk.

82
00:06:35,988 --> 00:06:38,358
I'm not your grandson.

83
00:06:38,418 --> 00:06:42,288
So stressful. Hey. Come on, go back to sleep.

84
00:06:42,358 --> 00:06:44,688
You must have woken up and started sleep-talking.

85
00:06:44,898 --> 00:06:46,698
Go get some proper sleep. Go on.

86
00:06:48,628 --> 00:06:50,728
Gyeol, are you in the bathroom?

87
00:06:51,428 --> 00:06:54,168
Hey, Gyu Rim. Get Gyeol out of here, now.

88
00:06:54,568 --> 00:06:57,708
He's sleep-talking like he's wide awake.

89
00:06:58,108 --> 00:06:59,978
So I can finish up. Get out, quick.

90
00:07:07,518 --> 00:07:08,518
Gyeol.

91
00:07:09,788 --> 00:07:10,888
Grandpa is trying to use the restroom.

92
00:07:10,948 --> 00:07:12,688
What were you doing in there?

93
00:07:13,918 --> 00:07:17,028
I was trying to ask who I am.

94
00:07:18,128 --> 00:07:19,498
What do you mean, "who are you?"

95
00:07:19,958 --> 00:07:22,398
You're Grandpa's grandson and my son.

96
00:07:24,568 --> 00:07:25,568
Gyeol.

97
00:07:27,068 --> 00:07:28,908
Don't worry about me.

98
00:07:32,938 --> 00:07:34,948
How can you say that to your mom?

99
00:07:38,778 --> 00:07:40,748
And why do you keep speaking so formally to me?

100
00:07:41,748 --> 00:07:43,988
Why are you suddenly speaking so formally?

101
00:07:44,048 --> 00:07:46,958
- Like some other family's kid. - Because I am.

102
00:07:47,158 --> 00:07:48,158
Gyeol.

103
00:07:48,928 --> 00:07:50,058
And it's because...

104
00:07:50,128 --> 00:07:52,828
you're not my mom, ma'am.

105
00:08:05,778 --> 00:08:07,478
What is he talking about?

106
00:08:11,008 --> 00:08:13,648
Uncles, I need to talk to you.

107
00:08:14,678 --> 00:08:17,548
Uncle. Quick.

108
00:08:22,758 --> 00:08:24,188
What time is it?

109
00:08:30,328 --> 00:08:32,198
A little after five.

110
00:08:34,738 --> 00:08:36,668
What's going on this early?

111
00:08:37,138 --> 00:08:38,138
I'm sorry.

112
00:08:38,338 --> 00:08:40,238
It's just that this is very important to me.

113
00:08:42,408 --> 00:08:43,778
What's so important?

114
00:08:43,978 --> 00:08:46,878
I have a bit of a birth secret.

115
00:08:49,118 --> 00:08:50,388
My mom.

116
00:08:52,258 --> 00:08:54,458
I'm not Han Gyu Rim's son.

117
00:08:54,888 --> 00:08:56,128
What are you talking about?

118
00:08:56,688 --> 00:08:58,858
If you're not her son, are you her daughter?

119
00:08:59,858 --> 00:09:03,128
By any chance, did you see my mom give birth to me?

120
00:09:05,098 --> 00:09:07,568
I didn't see you being born, no. I was in the army.

121
00:09:08,708 --> 00:09:10,008
When I came home on leave later,

122
00:09:10,068 --> 00:09:11,838
I saw you when you were the size of a caterpillar.

123
00:09:14,008 --> 00:09:16,608
So anyway, you didn't see me being born, right?

124
00:09:18,818 --> 00:09:22,288
Wait, what's all this about so early in the morning?

125
00:09:23,088 --> 00:09:24,348
Did you fight with your mom?

126
00:09:32,098 --> 00:09:34,298
Uncle. Youngest uncle.

127
00:09:35,068 --> 00:09:36,068
What?

128
00:09:36,198 --> 00:09:38,768
Uncle, did you see my mom give birth to me?

129
00:09:39,138 --> 00:09:41,138
Did you see my mom give birth to me?

130
00:09:42,468 --> 00:09:44,168
No, I didn't.

131
00:09:55,548 --> 00:09:56,888
See?

132
00:09:58,318 --> 00:10:00,018
There's no one.

133
00:10:02,928 --> 00:10:04,888
Anyone who saw me being born...

134
00:10:06,958 --> 00:10:08,568
There's no one.

135
00:10:28,718 --> 00:10:30,088
Why are you sitting there like that?

136
00:10:31,988 --> 00:10:33,088
Gyeol,

137
00:10:33,888 --> 00:10:35,328
talk to me.

138
00:10:36,888 --> 00:10:39,058
This kid.

139
00:10:40,258 --> 00:10:41,798
Oh, Gyeol. Good morning.

140
00:10:43,998 --> 00:10:45,028
Well...

141
00:10:45,098 --> 00:10:46,238
What?

142
00:10:47,168 --> 00:10:48,638
Hey, what's wrong with Gyeol today?

143
00:10:51,368 --> 00:10:54,978
You didn't really give birth to Gyeol? Seriously?

144
00:10:58,718 --> 00:11:00,078
He's my son.

145
00:11:00,648 --> 00:11:02,218
I'm not asking if he's your son.

146
00:11:02,218 --> 00:11:04,588
I'm asking if you actually gave birth to him.

147
00:11:04,648 --> 00:11:05,658
Yes.

148
00:11:06,588 --> 00:11:07,988
I gave birth to him.

149
00:11:09,058 --> 00:11:10,528
He's my son.

150
00:11:10,888 --> 00:11:13,328
Right. Of course. That makes sense.

151
00:11:13,558 --> 00:11:16,568
Why would you raise a child that isn't yours? Right?

152
00:11:16,628 --> 00:11:17,668
Especially when you were being judged...

153
00:11:17,728 --> 00:11:18,738
for being a single mother...

154
00:11:19,298 --> 00:11:20,438
Seriously...

155
00:11:20,538 --> 00:11:22,438
Where could Gyeol have heard something like that?

156
00:11:23,138 --> 00:11:24,808
Oh, is it because of that silly story...

157
00:11:24,868 --> 00:11:25,978
about kids being found under a bridge?

158
00:11:26,038 --> 00:11:27,208
That must be it, right?

159
00:11:27,678 --> 00:11:29,348
Hey, when you were pregnant with Gyeol,

160
00:11:29,408 --> 00:11:30,848
show him the ultrasound photos.

161
00:11:30,908 --> 00:11:32,478
That'll solve it, right?

162
00:11:32,848 --> 00:11:33,848
What?

163
00:11:34,378 --> 00:11:36,388
- Why... - What's this?

164
00:11:36,448 --> 00:11:37,448
Gosh.

165
00:11:39,518 --> 00:11:40,718
Hey.

166
00:11:41,288 --> 00:11:44,458
Gyeol is your sister's son, right? Tell me the truth.

167
00:11:46,298 --> 00:11:49,098
Dad, are you even my father? Seriously?

168
00:11:50,368 --> 00:11:52,368
Oh, please tell me you're not. Please.

169
00:11:54,338 --> 00:11:55,708
I'm washing my hands of this.

170
00:12:00,078 --> 00:12:01,078
Gyeol.

171
00:12:02,748 --> 00:12:04,548
You don't want to talk to me?

172
00:12:05,108 --> 00:12:07,018
No, I don't, ma'am.

173
00:12:43,018 --> 00:12:44,988
Hoon Tae told you, right?

174
00:12:47,088 --> 00:12:48,928
That Gyu Rim is my daughter.

175
00:12:50,388 --> 00:12:51,528
And that's why...

176
00:12:53,358 --> 00:12:56,428
I was so against you and Seo Hyun getting together.

177
00:12:59,138 --> 00:13:00,138
Yes.

178
00:13:02,908 --> 00:13:04,338
I'm sorry, Mu Jin.

179
00:13:07,108 --> 00:13:08,138
To you,

180
00:13:09,708 --> 00:13:12,018
to Hoon Tae, and to Seo Hyun.

181
00:13:13,978 --> 00:13:16,488
I've done something unforgivable.

182
00:13:19,288 --> 00:13:21,258
How can the world be...

183
00:13:21,318 --> 00:13:22,828
so small.

184
00:13:25,028 --> 00:13:27,798
I just can't believe how small the world is...

185
00:13:28,768 --> 00:13:29,928
As for Gyu Rim,

186
00:13:31,898 --> 00:13:33,138
aren't you sorry for her?

187
00:13:37,668 --> 00:13:39,078
You said you never once saw Gyu Rim...

188
00:13:40,178 --> 00:13:41,878
after your divorce.

189
00:13:45,518 --> 00:13:48,948
That you never contacted her or went to see her.

190
00:13:51,118 --> 00:13:52,618
But you're her mother.

191
00:13:54,358 --> 00:13:56,158
Weren't you curious how your daughter was living...

192
00:13:56,388 --> 00:13:59,158
or what she was growing up to be?

193
00:14:00,228 --> 00:14:01,728
I was curious, but I resisted.

194
00:14:04,368 --> 00:14:05,938
I missed her, but I endured it.

195
00:14:08,638 --> 00:14:11,408
I tried with all my might to forget her and move on.

196
00:14:14,138 --> 00:14:15,348
So that I could survive.

197
00:14:17,808 --> 00:14:19,518
It felt like the only way I could go on living.

198
00:14:25,558 --> 00:14:27,858
I wanted to be devoted to my new family.

199
00:14:29,388 --> 00:14:31,488
Hoon Tae thinks the world of me.

200
00:14:32,658 --> 00:14:36,228
And Seo Hyun, even though she knows I'm not her birth mother,

201
00:14:36,298 --> 00:14:38,228
she never leaves my side.

202
00:14:39,268 --> 00:14:41,468
To Hoon Tae and to Seo Hyun,

203
00:14:42,668 --> 00:14:45,308
I wanted to repay them too.

204
00:14:46,278 --> 00:14:47,278
What about Gyu Rim?

205
00:14:49,048 --> 00:14:50,948
Gyu Rim needed a mother too.

206
00:14:52,278 --> 00:14:53,818
She must have longed for...

207
00:14:54,418 --> 00:14:56,648
a mother's warmth every single day.

208
00:14:59,158 --> 00:15:00,658
Gyu Rim is a strong kid.

209
00:15:02,658 --> 00:15:04,588
She's brave and resilient.

210
00:15:06,758 --> 00:15:08,198
She always pulls through...

211
00:15:08,998 --> 00:15:09,998
and she...

212
00:15:12,668 --> 00:15:14,968
must have endured it. I trust Gyu Rim.

213
00:15:15,268 --> 00:15:18,008
How can you say that? She was just a child.

214
00:15:19,238 --> 00:15:21,508
A child who desperately needed her mother.

215
00:15:25,178 --> 00:15:26,718
Apologise to Gyu Rim.

216
00:15:27,618 --> 00:15:28,718
Even now.

217
00:15:31,818 --> 00:15:32,988
I'm not going to see her.

218
00:15:33,818 --> 00:15:35,658
- No, I can't. - Ma'am.

219
00:15:35,728 --> 00:15:37,588
I'm never going to see her again.

220
00:15:42,268 --> 00:15:43,868
Besides, for Gyu Rim...

221
00:15:47,398 --> 00:15:49,238
she's better off without me.

222
00:15:57,308 --> 00:15:58,648
You're being cruel...

223
00:16:00,348 --> 00:16:01,878
and selfish to the very end.

224
00:16:07,018 --> 00:16:08,018
Yes.

225
00:16:09,428 --> 00:16:10,428
That's right.

226
00:16:13,198 --> 00:16:16,728
I never knew I could be this selfish and cruel.

227
00:16:54,638 --> 00:16:55,668
Where did he go?

228
00:16:57,938 --> 00:16:58,978
Ma'am.

229
00:17:02,378 --> 00:17:03,508
Why are you following me?

230
00:17:04,848 --> 00:17:07,078
I was worried you might skip school.

231
00:17:07,518 --> 00:17:10,688
I don't ditch school, no matter how tough things get.

232
00:17:11,088 --> 00:17:15,118
I know. But I was still worried, just in case.

233
00:17:15,318 --> 00:17:16,328
Ma'am.

234
00:17:16,428 --> 00:17:18,158
Can you please stop calling me that?

235
00:17:18,798 --> 00:17:20,458
Why are you calling me that?

236
00:17:20,798 --> 00:17:22,098
Then should I call you my sister?

237
00:17:22,468 --> 00:17:25,098
My friends already think it's weird how young you look.

238
00:17:25,168 --> 00:17:27,098
They say you look like a pop star.

239
00:17:29,468 --> 00:17:31,208
I am your mom, Gyeol.

240
00:17:32,278 --> 00:17:35,438
I can tell the whole world that I am your mom.

241
00:17:35,708 --> 00:17:36,748
Whatever.

242
00:17:36,908 --> 00:17:38,008
I'm serious.

243
00:17:39,178 --> 00:17:41,818
I'll keep shouting it until you believe me.

244
00:17:41,978 --> 00:17:45,088
But you're a textbook introvert.

245
00:17:45,588 --> 00:17:47,958
You hate being embarrassed more than anything.

246
00:17:51,628 --> 00:17:53,558
I am Gyeol's mom!

247
00:17:54,058 --> 00:17:56,368
I am Han Gyeol's mom!

248
00:17:57,068 --> 00:18:00,868
- I, Han Gyu Rim, am Gyeol's mom! - No, no. Stop it.

249
00:18:01,068 --> 00:18:02,068
- I said stop. - I wouldn't trade...

250
00:18:02,138 --> 00:18:05,208
my son, Han Gyeol, for the entire world.

251
00:18:05,208 --> 00:18:06,908
- No, no. Stop it. - Hello.

252
00:18:06,978 --> 00:18:08,378
Oh, hello. You should get inside.

253
00:18:08,678 --> 00:18:09,848
- Han Gyeol is... - Stop.

254
00:18:10,048 --> 00:18:12,678
the one Han Gyu Rim loves most...

255
00:18:12,748 --> 00:18:15,548
- in this world. - Mom, stop it. Just stop.

256
00:18:16,888 --> 00:18:18,288
Will you believe me now?

257
00:18:19,918 --> 00:18:20,918
Han Gyeol.

258
00:18:24,988 --> 00:18:27,058
Your mom is so cool, Han Gyeol.

259
00:18:27,128 --> 00:18:29,528
I wish I had a cool and pretty mom like you do.

260
00:18:29,598 --> 00:18:31,068
I really do.

261
00:18:31,568 --> 00:18:32,898
Hello, Ms. Kwon.

262
00:18:35,298 --> 00:18:36,868
I'll be heading in now.

263
00:18:38,878 --> 00:18:41,278
Gyeol, listen to your teacher...

264
00:18:41,538 --> 00:18:43,378
and get along with your friends.

265
00:18:44,378 --> 00:18:47,318
I'll take good care of Gyeol, so please don't worry.

266
00:18:47,648 --> 00:18:48,648
Thank you.

267
00:18:51,188 --> 00:18:53,718
Han Gyeol, wait up.

268
00:19:01,428 --> 00:19:02,468
Han Gyeol.

269
00:19:09,368 --> 00:19:11,568
Man, I'm so tired.

270
00:19:17,648 --> 00:19:19,678
This is driving me crazy.

271
00:19:20,078 --> 00:19:21,648
Why won't you agree to a settlement? Why?

272
00:19:22,078 --> 00:19:23,688
Your mom has a lot of money.

273
00:19:24,088 --> 00:19:27,118
Why would I settle when I didn't do anything wrong?

274
00:19:27,418 --> 00:19:29,228
I will never settle.

275
00:19:30,558 --> 00:19:32,058
Just go.

276
00:19:33,128 --> 00:19:34,498
Are you trying to get revenge on me right now?

277
00:19:34,798 --> 00:19:36,898
Are you using everything you've been holding a grudge about...

278
00:19:36,968 --> 00:19:38,268
to get back at me?

279
00:19:38,428 --> 00:19:40,998
I believe in punishment, not revenge.

280
00:19:43,008 --> 00:19:45,708
If I had known what kind of jerk Sung Wook was,

281
00:19:45,778 --> 00:19:48,138
I would have beaten him to a pulp before he ever met you.

282
00:19:48,478 --> 00:19:50,908
Seriously, this is all Han Gyu Rim's fault.

283
00:19:51,348 --> 00:19:52,418
If it weren't for Han Gyu Rim,

284
00:19:52,478 --> 00:19:53,818
I never would've met someone like you.

285
00:19:54,518 --> 00:19:57,048
She's been completely useless my entire life.

286
00:19:57,148 --> 00:19:59,358
Blame the right person.

287
00:19:59,858 --> 00:20:01,588
If it weren't for your sister,

288
00:20:01,658 --> 00:20:04,428
would you even be able to stand on your own two feet right now?

289
00:20:04,928 --> 00:20:05,998
Whatever.

290
00:20:06,298 --> 00:20:08,658
Because of you, my wedding is completely ruined.

291
00:20:09,068 --> 00:20:10,068
With Sung Wook in his condition,

292
00:20:10,068 --> 00:20:11,928
we can't have our wedding or honeymoon.

293
00:20:12,128 --> 00:20:13,398
How are you going to pay for it?

294
00:20:13,798 --> 00:20:15,438
The cancellation fees are astronomical.

295
00:20:15,498 --> 00:20:17,408
So how are you going to pay for it?

296
00:20:17,508 --> 00:20:20,078
I'll pay the fees even if I have to sell my body,

297
00:20:20,138 --> 00:20:21,138
so don't worry.

298
00:20:22,278 --> 00:20:23,908
But as for beating up Sung Wook,

299
00:20:24,478 --> 00:20:27,248
I will never agree to a settlement for that.

300
00:20:27,318 --> 00:20:28,348
Are you serious?

301
00:20:28,878 --> 00:20:32,858
They say birds of a feather flock together.

302
00:20:33,058 --> 00:20:35,858
It's amazing how you two, like identical twins,

303
00:20:35,928 --> 00:20:36,928
found each other.

304
00:20:40,298 --> 00:20:44,468
Think of me as your saviour and call off this wedding.

305
00:20:45,128 --> 00:20:49,108
- This is your last warning. - A saviour? Give me a break.

306
00:20:49,768 --> 00:20:53,138
Fine. Don't settle. Don't you dare settle.

307
00:20:53,308 --> 00:20:55,438
Don't settle, and just go rot in prison,

308
00:20:55,508 --> 00:20:56,508
Jo Heung Sik.

309
00:20:56,508 --> 00:20:57,848
My gosh. What do I do?

310
00:20:57,848 --> 00:20:59,318
No, this is no time for this.

311
00:20:59,378 --> 00:21:02,078
My Heung Sik! Which jail is my Heung Sik in?

312
00:21:02,588 --> 00:21:04,888
Instead of going to the jail, you should settle first.

313
00:21:05,118 --> 00:21:07,588
You have to settle to get Jo Heung Sik out, don't you?

314
00:21:07,658 --> 00:21:10,028
Right, a settlement.

315
00:21:10,458 --> 00:21:12,658
Okay, so where do I go and how do I settle?

316
00:21:13,028 --> 00:21:14,258
You can settle with me.

317
00:21:14,798 --> 00:21:16,898
Recovery will take 20 weeks. He lost 6 teeth.

318
00:21:16,968 --> 00:21:18,628
Surgery, treatment, hospitalization, nursing fees,

319
00:21:18,698 --> 00:21:19,968
compensation for emotional distress,

320
00:21:20,098 --> 00:21:21,968
plus the wedding, reception, and honeymoon,

321
00:21:22,068 --> 00:21:23,908
cancellation fees. You have to pay for it all.

322
00:21:25,168 --> 00:21:26,338
How much is all that?

323
00:21:27,338 --> 00:21:28,978
I hear you have about three more shops...

324
00:21:29,048 --> 00:21:30,048
besides this one.

325
00:21:31,078 --> 00:21:32,248
Just sell one of them.

326
00:21:33,778 --> 00:21:35,848
Darn it. This little vixen...

327
00:21:35,918 --> 00:21:39,018
is talking utter nonsense.

328
00:21:39,258 --> 00:21:42,118
So you're just going to let Jo Heung Sik rot in prison?

329
00:21:42,688 --> 00:21:45,158
Are you going to let your son get a criminal record?

330
00:21:45,228 --> 00:21:47,958
Oh, dear.

331
00:21:51,198 --> 00:21:52,968
Your world is falling apart, isn't it?

332
00:21:53,268 --> 00:21:55,368
I feel like I'm going to go crazy too.

333
00:21:55,838 --> 00:21:57,408
So before this gets out to more people...

334
00:21:57,468 --> 00:22:00,808
Gyeol's Mom was born in March in the Year of the Dog,

335
00:22:01,308 --> 00:22:05,848
and she said her younger sister was born 11 months later...

336
00:22:05,918 --> 00:22:06,978
Pig...

337
00:22:08,318 --> 00:22:09,388
Does that mean you were born in February...

338
00:22:09,448 --> 00:22:10,448
in the Year of the Pig?

339
00:22:11,118 --> 00:22:12,858
Why are you asking for my birth date?

340
00:22:13,458 --> 00:22:15,358
She was right.

341
00:22:15,858 --> 00:22:17,258
The shaman at Wolseongdang...

342
00:22:17,558 --> 00:22:19,358
told me to be very, very careful of someone...

343
00:22:19,428 --> 00:22:21,128
born in February in the Year of the Pig.

344
00:22:21,558 --> 00:22:22,568
Even if they offer you...

345
00:22:22,628 --> 00:22:23,628
the most delicious treat in the world,

346
00:22:23,698 --> 00:22:25,498
she said not to even go near them.

347
00:22:26,138 --> 00:22:28,838
- What is she saying? - In my Heung Sik's fortune,

348
00:22:28,898 --> 00:22:29,968
if he gets close to someone...

349
00:22:30,038 --> 00:22:31,608
born in February in the Year of the Pig,

350
00:22:31,738 --> 00:22:34,508
everything would just go up in flames.

351
00:22:34,608 --> 00:22:38,408
- Ma'am. - Get out. Forget the settlement.

352
00:22:38,478 --> 00:22:39,878
I don't want to speak to someone...

353
00:22:39,878 --> 00:22:41,418
born in February in the Year of the Pig.

354
00:22:41,478 --> 00:22:42,488
Get lost.

355
00:22:43,688 --> 00:22:46,658
Don't you dare hang around my Heung Sik.

356
00:22:46,958 --> 00:22:48,818
Next time, it'll be for attempted murder...

357
00:22:48,888 --> 00:22:51,588
that you and I will have to settle. You hear me?

358
00:22:51,828 --> 00:22:53,358
Where did this "Born in February in the Year of the Pig"...

359
00:22:53,358 --> 00:22:57,828
nonsense come from? Ma'am, you can't lose your mind too.

360
00:22:57,928 --> 00:22:59,738
Are you really going to let your son become a convict?

361
00:22:59,798 --> 00:23:01,368
Go on, get out of here.

362
00:23:01,768 --> 00:23:03,768
Or do I have to take this spinach water...

363
00:23:03,838 --> 00:23:06,108
and splash it on your face?

364
00:23:08,008 --> 00:23:10,278
Darn it, I can't reason with her.

365
00:23:13,818 --> 00:23:14,818
Those born in February in the Year of the Pig...

366
00:23:14,878 --> 00:23:17,388
are terrifying, right? If this wedding gets called off,

367
00:23:17,588 --> 00:23:20,318
I'll just go and marry Jo Heung Sik.

368
00:23:21,988 --> 00:23:24,488
No. That little brat!

369
00:23:27,398 --> 00:23:28,998
(Suragan Side Dishes)

370
00:24:07,168 --> 00:24:08,168
Hey.

371
00:24:09,808 --> 00:24:10,808
Can't you see me?

372
00:24:13,708 --> 00:24:14,908
What are you doing here?

373
00:24:15,438 --> 00:24:16,448
Didn't you go to work?

374
00:24:16,508 --> 00:24:17,548
That Jo Heung Sik...

375
00:24:23,148 --> 00:24:24,748
I didn't come home last night.

376
00:24:25,788 --> 00:24:27,388
You didn't even notice I wasn't home, did you?

377
00:24:29,928 --> 00:24:31,228
You're not a kid.

378
00:24:31,528 --> 00:24:33,558
Do I have to worry about you on top of everything else?

379
00:24:33,998 --> 00:24:35,898
I'm fine with us disowning each other,

380
00:24:35,968 --> 00:24:37,498
but I'm not married yet.

381
00:24:37,868 --> 00:24:39,338
Let's wait until after I'm married to do it.

382
00:24:39,398 --> 00:24:40,398
To make it meaningful.

383
00:24:42,098 --> 00:24:43,108
I'm leaving.

384
00:24:55,988 --> 00:24:57,418
I have a question.

385
00:24:58,018 --> 00:24:59,858
If the mother is Type O,

386
00:25:00,358 --> 00:25:04,058
is it really impossible for her to have a Type AB child?

387
00:25:07,528 --> 00:25:10,128
- What are you talking about? - No, what if the father is Type AB?

388
00:25:10,398 --> 00:25:11,668
Isn't that possible?

389
00:25:12,638 --> 00:25:15,198
Are you trying to show me how clueless you are?

390
00:25:18,568 --> 00:25:20,178
Why am I so stupid?

391
00:25:20,808 --> 00:25:23,078
I can't believe I didn't even know that.

392
00:25:25,048 --> 00:25:26,278
Gyeol isn't your son, is he?

393
00:25:27,818 --> 00:25:29,418
Gyeol called me.

394
00:25:29,788 --> 00:25:31,388
He asked if I knew who his real mom was.

395
00:25:31,848 --> 00:25:33,118
So what did you tell him?

396
00:25:33,318 --> 00:25:34,858
I told him I didn't know.

397
00:25:34,918 --> 00:25:35,918
When I got back from studying abroad,

398
00:25:35,988 --> 00:25:37,128
he had already been born.

399
00:25:37,188 --> 00:25:38,958
Why would you tell him that?

400
00:25:39,458 --> 00:25:41,598
You could've just said that I'm his mom.

401
00:25:41,658 --> 00:25:43,428
I only state the facts.

402
00:25:44,368 --> 00:25:45,368
Wait.

403
00:25:47,198 --> 00:25:49,198
So Gyeol really isn't your son?

404
00:25:49,438 --> 00:25:51,608
Then why are you raising a kid who isn't even yours?

405
00:25:52,268 --> 00:25:53,278
That's enough.

406
00:25:54,408 --> 00:25:55,508
Let's just stop.

407
00:25:58,148 --> 00:25:59,148
Hey.

408
00:25:59,878 --> 00:26:02,078
Who is Gyeol's real mom? What does she do?

409
00:26:02,148 --> 00:26:03,518
You've never even changed one of his diapers.

410
00:26:03,688 --> 00:26:05,088
So shut your mouth.

411
00:26:05,648 --> 00:26:08,458
- Gyeol is my son. - You're insane.

412
00:26:08,518 --> 00:26:10,028
You've completely lost it.

413
00:26:10,558 --> 00:26:12,528
Is charity your talent and self-sacrifice your hobby?

414
00:26:12,858 --> 00:26:14,358
You're not married, but you let them call you a single mom...

415
00:26:14,428 --> 00:26:15,998
and let the whole world judge you.

416
00:26:16,068 --> 00:26:17,868
You don't care about me.

417
00:26:18,398 --> 00:26:20,168
So be consistent and just stay out of it.

418
00:26:20,468 --> 00:26:21,598
You're so annoying.

419
00:26:22,768 --> 00:26:24,508
Weren't the twins enough for you?

420
00:26:25,008 --> 00:26:27,638
Why are you so busy sacrificing yourself for everyone?

421
00:26:27,878 --> 00:26:30,248
Just get government funding and open an orphanage or something.

422
00:26:30,308 --> 00:26:31,308
Seriously.

423
00:26:32,508 --> 00:26:34,278
Why bother waiting for the wedding?

424
00:26:34,678 --> 00:26:36,948
Let's just disown each other right now.

425
00:26:38,888 --> 00:26:40,588
Darn it, did she break my nose?

426
00:26:40,718 --> 00:26:41,958
The back of my head, now the front...

427
00:26:42,488 --> 00:26:44,688
Did you two team up to take me down today?

428
00:26:45,058 --> 00:26:46,958
Hey, Han Gyu Rim.

429
00:26:50,728 --> 00:26:51,998
Darn it.

430
00:27:02,778 --> 00:27:04,048
Have you eaten?

431
00:27:05,248 --> 00:27:06,778
I moved my things out of the house.

432
00:27:11,218 --> 00:27:13,258
(Chairman Jang Hoon Tae)

433
00:27:16,958 --> 00:27:18,958
I'll ask you one last time.

434
00:27:22,898 --> 00:27:24,468
You were just messing with me, right?

435
00:27:26,398 --> 00:27:29,408
You always loved messing with me, Dad.

436
00:27:30,708 --> 00:27:32,508
You're just joking around this time too, right?

437
00:27:42,718 --> 00:27:46,518
I was totally shocked, and I completely fell for it.

438
00:27:47,158 --> 00:27:48,558
So just tell me it's over now.

439
00:27:49,118 --> 00:27:50,588
Tell me the joke is finished.

440
00:27:50,688 --> 00:27:52,388
That I can stop being frozen in place.

441
00:27:55,028 --> 00:27:56,898
I said, stop joking around.

442
00:27:56,968 --> 00:27:59,838
This kind of joke isn't funny. I absolutely hate it.

443
00:28:01,038 --> 00:28:02,098
Listen to me.

444
00:28:02,838 --> 00:28:05,968
I'm going to step away from managing the company for a while.

445
00:28:06,638 --> 00:28:08,938
I don't know if it will be for 1 year or 2.

446
00:28:09,808 --> 00:28:11,578
In the meantime, your mother and I will go...

447
00:28:11,648 --> 00:28:13,118
to our farm on Jeju Island and rest,

448
00:28:14,578 --> 00:28:17,948
until you've calmed down and sorted out your feelings.

449
00:28:19,818 --> 00:28:21,118
So you're serious, then?

450
00:28:24,558 --> 00:28:27,528
After making this huge mess, you're just going to run away?

451
00:28:27,598 --> 00:28:28,658
Like a coward?

452
00:28:31,498 --> 00:28:33,398
I don't know how Mom can stand you.

453
00:28:33,898 --> 00:28:36,038
How can she be with someone as loathsome as you?

454
00:28:36,098 --> 00:28:38,368
Eat with you, sleep in the same bed,

455
00:28:38,438 --> 00:28:40,878
talk with you, and breathe the same air?

456
00:28:41,038 --> 00:28:43,048
My mom must not be human.

457
00:28:45,378 --> 00:28:47,048
Divorce her first.

458
00:28:49,348 --> 00:28:51,218
My mom is too soft-hearted to say it,

459
00:28:51,288 --> 00:28:52,748
so I'm saying it for her.

460
00:28:54,018 --> 00:28:56,428
Divorce her and let her go.

461
00:28:58,128 --> 00:29:00,058
Since you're the one at fault,

462
00:29:00,128 --> 00:29:02,358
you should sign over all your assets to her too.

463
00:29:04,098 --> 00:29:05,098
Seo Hyun.

464
00:29:06,638 --> 00:29:08,068
That's what I came to say.

465
00:29:11,338 --> 00:29:14,938
If you move your things out, I'll move back in and live with Mom.

466
00:29:29,628 --> 00:29:31,788
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

467
00:29:36,198 --> 00:29:37,298
Good.

468
00:29:38,698 --> 00:29:39,738
Very good.

469
00:29:41,668 --> 00:29:43,038
Hey, this is all great,

470
00:29:43,108 --> 00:29:46,068
but what's the point of having such a fantastic product...

471
00:29:46,138 --> 00:29:49,578
if the marketing that supports it isn't fantastic as well?

472
00:29:50,508 --> 00:29:53,578
So, is there still no word from that artist, Joel?

473
00:29:54,548 --> 00:29:55,548
No.

474
00:29:56,288 --> 00:29:59,488
I went to the address listed on his website in person,

475
00:29:59,618 --> 00:30:01,618
but he's the type who comes in whenever he feels like it,

476
00:30:01,688 --> 00:30:03,028
so meeting him isn't easy.

477
00:30:03,588 --> 00:30:05,228
I've also sent him DMs on social media,

478
00:30:05,288 --> 00:30:06,298
but he hasn't replied.

479
00:30:06,658 --> 00:30:08,058
His employees...

480
00:30:08,958 --> 00:30:11,198
say that hardly anyone there has even seen their boss's face.

481
00:30:11,798 --> 00:30:14,668
Well, this will be a problem even if we land the project.

482
00:30:14,738 --> 00:30:16,938
If he's that eccentric, how can we possibly work with him?

483
00:30:21,538 --> 00:30:22,538
Yes? What is it?

484
00:30:23,048 --> 00:30:24,878
You have a visitor, Chairman.

485
00:30:25,248 --> 00:30:26,248
Who is it?

486
00:30:33,318 --> 00:30:35,658
Well, I'll see myself out then.

487
00:30:42,558 --> 00:30:44,468
You met with Hoon Tae, didn't you?

488
00:30:46,568 --> 00:30:49,198
He was spouting such ridiculous nonsense,

489
00:30:49,438 --> 00:30:51,538
that I told him to get psychiatric help...

490
00:30:51,608 --> 00:30:52,608
and then we'd talk.

491
00:30:55,778 --> 00:30:58,708
I'm sorry to have put you in such an awkward position.

492
00:30:59,148 --> 00:31:00,148
I mean,

493
00:31:01,648 --> 00:31:04,748
were you conned by some guy who looks like my Mu Jin?

494
00:31:08,558 --> 00:31:11,528
If you don't approve of my Mu Jin,

495
00:31:11,588 --> 00:31:14,858
you could have just been honest with me and said so.

496
00:31:15,258 --> 00:31:18,568
Whose idea was this anyway?

497
00:31:19,468 --> 00:31:22,098
Does Jang Hoon Tae need to be committed to a hospital?

498
00:31:23,638 --> 00:31:24,968
I'm sorry.

499
00:31:26,478 --> 00:31:28,278
Even if I had ten mouths...

500
00:31:29,078 --> 00:31:30,648
I have no excuse.

501
00:31:30,708 --> 00:31:34,118
How dare you do this to a catch like my son?

502
00:31:36,018 --> 00:31:37,948
For Seo Hyun's late mother's sake,

503
00:31:38,018 --> 00:31:40,588
I treated you with every courtesy I could muster.

504
00:31:40,658 --> 00:31:41,858
But how dare you.

505
00:31:42,558 --> 00:31:44,058
You don't even know your place.

506
00:31:45,488 --> 00:31:47,498
How could you treat my son like that...

507
00:31:47,558 --> 00:31:49,668
and reject him so disgracefully?

508
00:31:52,168 --> 00:31:53,798
I'm sorry, Chairman.

509
00:31:55,268 --> 00:31:57,738
Why so quiet all of a sudden?

510
00:31:58,338 --> 00:32:03,048
Go on. Glare at me and say it out loud.

511
00:32:03,108 --> 00:32:05,808
Say, "Over my dead body will I accept Mu Jin."

512
00:32:05,878 --> 00:32:07,848
Go on and drive me crazy.

513
00:32:10,888 --> 00:32:12,418
You know what?

514
00:32:12,548 --> 00:32:13,958
For Seo Hyun's sake, I...

515
00:32:14,418 --> 00:32:15,988
I'm done with this. Okay?

516
00:32:16,688 --> 00:32:18,628
Tell Hoon Tae to delete my number.

517
00:32:18,688 --> 00:32:20,958
And tell him that our long relationship ends here.

518
00:32:21,098 --> 00:32:22,128
Relay that message.

519
00:32:23,798 --> 00:32:25,298
Han Gyu Rim is my daughter.

520
00:32:25,868 --> 00:32:26,868
What? Who is?

521
00:32:28,838 --> 00:32:32,008
The girl Mu Jin used to date.

522
00:32:34,978 --> 00:32:36,978
The one you treated like a gold digger.

523
00:32:39,748 --> 00:32:40,748
That girl.

524
00:32:43,448 --> 00:32:45,088
The one I left behind when I got divorced.

525
00:32:45,848 --> 00:32:47,058
She's my eldest daughter.

526
00:32:50,058 --> 00:32:52,958
What are you talking about right now? What?

527
00:32:53,958 --> 00:32:55,098
That's why I was so against...

528
00:32:55,158 --> 00:32:56,768
Seo Hyun and Mu Jin getting together.

529
00:32:57,168 --> 00:32:58,328
For not knowing my place.

530
00:33:01,168 --> 00:33:02,168
Wait a minute.

531
00:33:02,768 --> 00:33:05,408
Look here, Yoon Hee.

532
00:33:07,308 --> 00:33:08,408
Hoon Tae feared...

533
00:33:10,548 --> 00:33:13,118
she'd refuse to see me again,

534
00:33:14,418 --> 00:33:16,248
so he took all the blame.

535
00:33:17,418 --> 00:33:18,448
Oh my goodness.

536
00:33:26,188 --> 00:33:28,028
- Please have a seat over there. - Okay.

537
00:33:43,478 --> 00:33:45,448
Ma'am, I'd like a bottle of makgeolli.

538
00:33:45,848 --> 00:33:46,848
Okay.

539
00:33:53,988 --> 00:33:54,988
Hello.

540
00:33:56,358 --> 00:33:57,358
Do you know me?

541
00:33:58,058 --> 00:33:59,058
You don't know me?

542
00:33:59,488 --> 00:34:01,928
(Danim-Gil Kalguksu)

543
00:34:02,098 --> 00:34:04,398
So you're the long tooth grouper lady.

544
00:34:04,728 --> 00:34:05,728
Right?

545
00:34:06,398 --> 00:34:07,398
No.

546
00:34:08,338 --> 00:34:09,868
Your makgeolli.

547
00:34:11,838 --> 00:34:15,238
No, I just thought you looked a lot like her...

548
00:34:15,508 --> 00:34:17,078
I really didn't think it could be you.

549
00:34:17,248 --> 00:34:19,978
I was just coming from a wedding.

550
00:34:20,318 --> 00:34:22,578
Since you know each other, why not sit together?

551
00:34:22,578 --> 00:34:24,088
Okay? We're out of tables.

552
00:34:30,328 --> 00:34:31,458
Please, have a seat.

553
00:34:31,528 --> 00:34:33,428
- Okay. - Go on, sit down.

554
00:34:42,168 --> 00:34:43,168
So...

555
00:34:43,668 --> 00:34:45,238
Please be honest with me.

556
00:34:46,438 --> 00:34:47,608
What is it that you do?

557
00:34:48,908 --> 00:34:49,908
I run a sashimi place.

558
00:34:50,148 --> 00:34:52,278
No, you used to run that place.

559
00:34:52,708 --> 00:34:54,518
I reopened it. I have to make a living.

560
00:34:56,018 --> 00:34:57,318
I don't think so.

561
00:34:57,848 --> 00:34:59,648
You have a completely different aura.

562
00:35:00,688 --> 00:35:04,088
You have the air of a wealthy corporation chairman's wife.

563
00:35:04,858 --> 00:35:07,628
My younger sibling runs a dry cleaner,

564
00:35:07,698 --> 00:35:10,868
so I borrowed the nicest clothes they had.

565
00:35:15,798 --> 00:35:17,838
The food at the wedding must have been disappointing.

566
00:35:18,768 --> 00:35:19,768
You even ordered makgeolli.

567
00:35:23,208 --> 00:35:25,408
Something truly unbelievable happened.

568
00:35:26,378 --> 00:35:28,778
You too? Me too.

569
00:35:29,778 --> 00:35:30,788
Want to make a bet?

570
00:35:31,618 --> 00:35:33,858
On whose story is more unbelievable?

571
00:35:35,818 --> 00:35:36,828
You're on.

572
00:35:39,928 --> 00:35:42,198
Actually, no. I don't even want to talk about it.

573
00:35:42,728 --> 00:35:44,168
Oh, come on. Give it a try.

574
00:35:45,128 --> 00:35:46,128
Fifty dollars, all in.

575
00:35:48,198 --> 00:35:49,338
Wait, let me.

576
00:36:05,888 --> 00:36:07,658
My son's ex-girlfriend...

577
00:36:07,718 --> 00:36:09,658
and the girl he just started seeing...

578
00:36:09,718 --> 00:36:11,858
have the same mother.

579
00:36:12,058 --> 00:36:13,528
I could not believe it. Seriously.

580
00:36:14,598 --> 00:36:17,468
Could you say that one more time? I am not following.

581
00:36:17,528 --> 00:36:19,728
Oh, forget it. I am not saying it twice.

582
00:36:25,068 --> 00:36:26,068
I...

583
00:36:26,308 --> 00:36:28,078
raised him thinking he was my grandchild,

584
00:36:29,078 --> 00:36:30,178
but he isn't my grandchild.

585
00:36:37,348 --> 00:36:39,018
This kid messaged me again.

586
00:36:39,748 --> 00:36:41,858
Asking me to tell him about his birth secret.

587
00:36:41,958 --> 00:36:45,228
Calls, texts, messages, nonstop.

588
00:36:46,858 --> 00:36:48,298
I honestly have no idea.

589
00:36:59,308 --> 00:37:01,338
The 50 dollars is yours.

590
00:37:25,028 --> 00:37:27,268
Why are you staring at me like that? Want me to pour you one?

591
00:37:30,268 --> 00:37:31,268
No, it is not that.

592
00:37:32,608 --> 00:37:34,038
The way you down your drink in one shot...

593
00:37:35,208 --> 00:37:37,448
looked kind of cool,

594
00:37:38,248 --> 00:37:39,778
and I could not help but keep watching.

595
00:37:40,678 --> 00:37:42,718
What? Are you hitting on me right now?

596
00:37:44,918 --> 00:37:47,918
No. Am I crazy? Come on.

597
00:37:48,518 --> 00:37:51,928
I am absolutely sick and tired of women.

598
00:37:53,028 --> 00:37:55,598
Even if you tried your hardest to seduce me,

599
00:37:56,828 --> 00:37:58,428
I would never fall for it.

600
00:38:01,568 --> 00:38:04,008
I would never try to seduce you,

601
00:38:05,638 --> 00:38:07,038
but if I did, you would fall for it.

602
00:38:09,438 --> 00:38:10,908
No, I would not.

603
00:38:11,878 --> 00:38:13,308
When it comes to women,

604
00:38:14,848 --> 00:38:16,378
I'm completely fed up.

605
00:38:21,158 --> 00:38:22,258
Have you been fooled your whole life?

606
00:38:23,658 --> 00:38:24,658
Want to make a bet?

607
00:38:25,188 --> 00:38:27,928
Every time I say something, you want to bet? Really?

608
00:38:28,658 --> 00:38:31,828
Bet too much and you will end up with nothing overnight.

609
00:38:31,928 --> 00:38:32,928
Like me.

610
00:38:45,648 --> 00:38:46,648
Deal?

611
00:38:53,248 --> 00:38:54,258
Mu Jin.

612
00:38:56,018 --> 00:38:57,028
Hey, you are here?

613
00:38:58,088 --> 00:39:01,658
Is it okay if I call you casually when we are outside?

614
00:39:02,228 --> 00:39:03,228
Of course.

615
00:39:05,298 --> 00:39:06,298
What do you want to eat?

616
00:39:06,768 --> 00:39:08,868
Maybe in a bit.

617
00:39:09,338 --> 00:39:10,438
Have a seat first.

618
00:39:11,438 --> 00:39:12,438
Okay.

619
00:39:18,648 --> 00:39:22,248
If I asked you to tell me how Gyu Rim has been doing...

620
00:39:24,488 --> 00:39:26,248
since she broke up with me until recently,

621
00:39:28,018 --> 00:39:30,328
like the whole story of the past eight years,

622
00:39:30,688 --> 00:39:31,688
would that be too much?

623
00:39:33,188 --> 00:39:34,198
No.

624
00:39:34,928 --> 00:39:36,158
What took you so long to ask?

625
00:39:37,728 --> 00:39:40,338
I have always been ready to tell you.

626
00:39:42,738 --> 00:39:44,308
It is going to be a long story, though.

627
00:39:48,078 --> 00:39:49,278
Let me go grab some ice cream.

628
00:39:50,808 --> 00:39:51,808
Give me your card.

629
00:39:59,388 --> 00:40:02,188
Gyeol has my sister completely freaking out right now.

630
00:40:03,158 --> 00:40:05,258
He says he needs to know his birth secret,

631
00:40:05,528 --> 00:40:07,658
and he's been keeping everyone up since this morning.

632
00:40:08,228 --> 00:40:09,228
I see.

633
00:40:10,298 --> 00:40:11,898
Gyeol came to see me too.

634
00:40:15,338 --> 00:40:17,708
I was never good at school, so I do not really know,

635
00:40:18,108 --> 00:40:19,438
but is it really true that a Type O mother...

636
00:40:19,768 --> 00:40:22,578
cannot have a Type AB child?

637
00:40:23,038 --> 00:40:25,478
Like, regardless of the father's blood type?

638
00:40:27,878 --> 00:40:30,388
I thought my sister gave birth to Gyeol.

639
00:40:32,618 --> 00:40:35,318
She even showed me a photo of the baby in her belly.

640
00:40:35,788 --> 00:40:36,788
A photo?

641
00:40:40,528 --> 00:40:42,058
She showed you an ultrasound?

642
00:40:42,658 --> 00:40:44,798
- Yes. - When?

643
00:40:44,928 --> 00:40:47,768
Eight years ago, when I was in elementary school.

644
00:40:48,438 --> 00:40:51,268
Now that I think about it, it was an ultrasound photo,

645
00:40:51,868 --> 00:40:54,938
and she only showed it to me. She said it was her baby.

646
00:40:56,038 --> 00:40:57,908
She even had a nickname for the baby.

647
00:40:58,578 --> 00:40:59,908
What was it...

648
00:41:03,948 --> 00:41:05,118
I remember.

649
00:41:05,788 --> 00:41:06,788
Hope.

650
00:41:09,358 --> 00:41:12,228
My sister even had a baby bump this big.

651
00:41:16,228 --> 00:41:17,398
So I thought...

652
00:41:18,098 --> 00:41:21,338
maybe you were Gyeol's dad.

653
00:41:23,438 --> 00:41:24,668
So what happened?

654
00:41:25,508 --> 00:41:28,208
My sister even went to the hospital to give birth.

655
00:41:29,638 --> 00:41:30,648
Could it be...

656
00:41:31,278 --> 00:41:32,948
the babies were switched at the hospital?

657
00:41:55,068 --> 00:41:56,068
Start the car.

658
00:41:56,338 --> 00:41:57,708
Just take me somewhere. Anywhere.

659
00:42:07,378 --> 00:42:08,678
Want to just run away?

660
00:42:10,588 --> 00:42:12,148
Forget about family and everything...

661
00:42:12,588 --> 00:42:14,088
and let's just live together.

662
00:42:15,188 --> 00:42:16,618
Let's go somewhere no one will find us...

663
00:42:16,918 --> 00:42:18,558
and just be together, just the two of us. Okay?

664
00:42:33,978 --> 00:42:37,008
I said let's run away. So why did you just bring here?

665
00:42:42,348 --> 00:42:43,348
Have you eaten?

666
00:42:43,948 --> 00:42:44,948
Or, well,

667
00:42:46,488 --> 00:42:47,858
should I get you a sandwich or something?

668
00:42:49,318 --> 00:42:51,258
Be honest. You were relieved, weren't you?

669
00:42:54,128 --> 00:42:55,128
You were just dragging yourself along...

670
00:42:55,198 --> 00:42:56,198
out of obligation,

671
00:42:56,598 --> 00:42:58,928
and when you heard, "You two have to end it here,"

672
00:42:59,568 --> 00:43:00,798
you were secretly thrilled, weren't you?

673
00:43:04,738 --> 00:43:06,968
You know, I always had this weird, nagging feeling.

674
00:43:08,138 --> 00:43:09,138
That we...

675
00:43:09,578 --> 00:43:11,308
weren't going to make it all the way.

676
00:43:11,948 --> 00:43:14,018
I had a strange feeling like that.

677
00:43:18,048 --> 00:43:19,318
Let's just get a meal every now and then.

678
00:43:20,688 --> 00:43:21,888
If you want to eat something good,

679
00:43:22,558 --> 00:43:23,688
call me anytime.

680
00:43:25,528 --> 00:43:26,528
Every now and then?

681
00:43:29,798 --> 00:43:31,268
So now you only want to see me every now and then?

682
00:43:33,328 --> 00:43:34,338
Yes.

683
00:43:36,938 --> 00:43:38,168
Let's only see each other every now and then.

684
00:43:44,648 --> 00:43:46,378
This is sad.

685
00:43:47,618 --> 00:43:48,818
It's so unfair.

686
00:43:50,248 --> 00:43:52,488
We never even got to do anything.

687
00:43:54,318 --> 00:43:55,888
We never even went to the movies once.

688
00:43:55,958 --> 00:43:57,228
We never went on a trip.

689
00:43:58,458 --> 00:44:01,628
We never got couple rings. We never even kissed once.

690
00:44:03,598 --> 00:44:04,598
Where are you going?

691
00:44:05,498 --> 00:44:06,498
I'll take you.

692
00:44:08,138 --> 00:44:09,238
No mercy at all.

693
00:44:12,738 --> 00:44:14,808
You're not giving me any room at all, are you?

694
00:44:23,348 --> 00:44:24,818
I'll start the car and wait.

695
00:44:32,088 --> 00:44:33,428
Don't you dare date anyone else!

696
00:44:34,528 --> 00:44:35,958
Don't fall in love with anyone...

697
00:44:36,028 --> 00:44:37,928
and just die alone your whole life! Got it?

698
00:44:50,448 --> 00:44:52,108
Where will you go after you drop me off?

699
00:44:54,648 --> 00:44:55,648
To work.

700
00:45:01,418 --> 00:45:02,588
Go to Han Gyu Rim.

701
00:45:06,658 --> 00:45:09,028
I was just holding you back, so you couldn't go to her.

702
00:45:10,668 --> 00:45:11,768
Go to Han Gyu Rim.

703
00:45:15,038 --> 00:45:17,808
I don't know if it's sincerity or hypocrisy,

704
00:45:19,308 --> 00:45:22,638
but think of this as my gift to you for doing your best for me.

705
00:45:24,948 --> 00:45:26,078
Go to her, even if it's now.

706
00:45:29,878 --> 00:45:31,418
And this is a favour.

707
00:45:32,688 --> 00:45:34,188
If you two get back together,

708
00:45:35,788 --> 00:45:37,428
I want you to completely disappear.

709
00:45:40,858 --> 00:45:43,498
Go somewhere I will never hear anything about you two again.

710
00:45:44,368 --> 00:45:46,368
Disappear without a trace.

711
00:46:10,118 --> 00:46:11,658
Is it okay for you to be out here, away from your store?

712
00:46:13,228 --> 00:46:14,228
Gyeol...

713
00:46:15,428 --> 00:46:16,658
Gyeol isn't coming out.

714
00:46:18,198 --> 00:46:19,598
All the other kids are coming out,

715
00:46:20,498 --> 00:46:21,738
but Gyeol isn't.

716
00:46:25,708 --> 00:46:26,708
Snap out of it.

717
00:46:28,438 --> 00:46:29,738
I've never seen you...

718
00:46:29,808 --> 00:46:30,948
this distraught before.

719
00:46:32,108 --> 00:46:33,308
If you act like this,

720
00:46:33,448 --> 00:46:35,548
Gyeol will get more confused and anxious.

721
00:46:38,248 --> 00:46:39,248
Okay.

722
00:46:40,518 --> 00:46:41,588
I'll pull myself together.

723
00:46:43,458 --> 00:46:45,788
I'll wait for Gyeol, so you go back to the store. Go on.

724
00:46:48,158 --> 00:46:49,958
You are not this irresponsible.

725
00:46:50,028 --> 00:46:51,728
Why are you being like this? This isn't like you, Han Gyu Rim.

726
00:46:56,538 --> 00:46:57,538
Hey.

727
00:47:00,908 --> 00:47:01,908
Okay.

728
00:47:05,678 --> 00:47:06,908
Please take good care of Gyeol.

729
00:47:07,318 --> 00:47:08,318
I will.

730
00:47:18,888 --> 00:47:19,888
Gyu Oh.

731
00:47:23,028 --> 00:47:24,028
Gyeol...

732
00:47:25,168 --> 00:47:26,168
He's my son.

733
00:47:28,838 --> 00:47:29,838
I know.

734
00:47:30,198 --> 00:47:32,368
He means more to me than my own life.

735
00:47:34,038 --> 00:47:35,038
Hey.

736
00:47:36,638 --> 00:47:37,648
I know.

737
00:47:54,798 --> 00:47:55,798
Gyeol.

738
00:47:56,858 --> 00:47:57,868
Han Gyeol.

739
00:47:58,228 --> 00:48:00,568
Grade 1, Class 2, Han Gyeol.

740
00:48:01,568 --> 00:48:03,898
Gyeol. Han...

741
00:48:24,088 --> 00:48:25,088
Uncle.

742
00:48:27,858 --> 00:48:28,858
Gyeol.

743
00:48:29,358 --> 00:48:30,868
What are you doing at my school?

744
00:48:32,928 --> 00:48:34,198
I came to pick you up.

745
00:48:34,468 --> 00:48:36,838
Why? Are you worried I'm going to act out?

746
00:48:38,408 --> 00:48:41,138
No, I wanted to buy you something good to eat.

747
00:48:41,638 --> 00:48:45,248
That's okay. Ms. Kwon said she'd treat me.

748
00:48:50,948 --> 00:48:53,248
- Let's go, Ms. Kwon. - Okay.

749
00:49:09,138 --> 00:49:10,138
Are you uncomfortable?

750
00:49:11,008 --> 00:49:12,008
What?

751
00:49:12,108 --> 00:49:16,008
That we're eating pizza while my uncle is standing outside?

752
00:49:16,438 --> 00:49:17,608
Does that make you uncomfortable?

753
00:49:17,948 --> 00:49:18,948
No.

754
00:49:20,448 --> 00:49:21,678
Well, I feel uncomfortable.

755
00:49:23,418 --> 00:49:24,488
But even so,

756
00:49:24,488 --> 00:49:26,548
I don't want to talk to my family at all.

757
00:49:38,198 --> 00:49:39,198
Gyeol,

758
00:49:39,798 --> 00:49:42,598
I know you're very confused and shocked.

759
00:49:43,268 --> 00:49:45,608
But constantly avoiding your mom and your family like this...

760
00:49:45,668 --> 00:49:46,668
isn't the right thing to do.

761
00:49:47,808 --> 00:49:49,908
You don't have school tomorrow,

762
00:49:50,078 --> 00:49:51,948
so you and your mom should take a trip somewhere nice.

763
00:49:52,008 --> 00:49:53,078
You can ask her what you're curious about...

764
00:49:53,148 --> 00:49:54,148
and have her explain.

765
00:49:56,518 --> 00:49:58,518
Your mom is the best mom ever.

766
00:49:58,718 --> 00:50:01,188
I've met Da Som's mom, Jae Beom's mom,

767
00:50:01,288 --> 00:50:02,488
I've met them all.

768
00:50:02,858 --> 00:50:04,558
But I've never met a mom as devoted...

769
00:50:04,628 --> 00:50:06,258
and loving toward her child as Gyeol's Mom.

770
00:50:06,858 --> 00:50:07,858
It's true.

771
00:50:08,498 --> 00:50:11,728
Ms. Kwon, I want to go. I don't want pizza anymore.

772
00:50:12,398 --> 00:50:13,398
Gyeol.

773
00:50:17,238 --> 00:50:18,238
Han Gyeol.

774
00:50:18,608 --> 00:50:20,168
Ma'am, your bill?

775
00:50:24,878 --> 00:50:25,878
Han Gyeol.

776
00:50:27,978 --> 00:50:29,118
Talk to me for a minute.

777
00:50:29,248 --> 00:50:30,418
I have nothing to say.

778
00:50:30,888 --> 00:50:32,148
Well, I have something to say.

779
00:50:32,388 --> 00:50:34,988
I don't want to hear anything you have to say.

780
00:50:35,058 --> 00:50:38,128
Wow, you've really developed an attitude.

781
00:50:38,328 --> 00:50:39,728
You said you don't know anything.

782
00:50:40,458 --> 00:50:42,528
You said you didn't see my mom give birth to me.

783
00:50:42,598 --> 00:50:45,168
I didn't see my mom give birth to me either.

784
00:50:46,998 --> 00:50:48,498
I need time to think.

785
00:50:48,868 --> 00:50:51,738
Tell that to Ms. Han Gyu Rim, too.

786
00:50:54,638 --> 00:50:55,778
Ms. Han Gyu Rim?

787
00:50:56,238 --> 00:50:58,478
Do you have any idea what state your mom is in because of you?

788
00:50:58,908 --> 00:51:00,608
Gyeol, you can't just say whatever you want.

789
00:51:00,678 --> 00:51:01,978
Calm down, Gyeol's Uncle.

790
00:51:05,448 --> 00:51:06,888
Goodbye, Ms. Kwon.

791
00:51:10,358 --> 00:51:13,188
Hey, where are you going? Home is the other way.

792
00:51:14,088 --> 00:51:15,598
I'm not going to my house.

793
00:51:16,028 --> 00:51:17,628
I'm going to Mr. Mu Jin's.

794
00:51:18,768 --> 00:51:20,668
Why are you going there?

795
00:51:22,068 --> 00:51:24,238
Why does a little kid have to cause so much trouble?

796
00:51:24,368 --> 00:51:26,108
How can you act just like him?

797
00:51:31,048 --> 00:51:33,978
Gyeol may be precocious, but he's still just a child.

798
00:51:36,848 --> 00:51:38,648
If there's someone Gyeol feels he can lean on,

799
00:51:39,618 --> 00:51:41,088
you should let him.

800
00:51:42,588 --> 00:51:43,758
As long as you can trust them.

801
00:51:51,898 --> 00:51:53,368
I never thought we'd meet like this.

802
00:51:57,498 --> 00:51:58,538
You don't recognise me?

803
00:51:59,238 --> 00:52:01,908
Han Gyu Oh. You really don't remember?

804
00:52:04,278 --> 00:52:05,278
I don't.

805
00:52:05,978 --> 00:52:07,278
I've erased all my memories of it.

806
00:52:09,948 --> 00:52:10,948
So,

807
00:52:11,948 --> 00:52:13,888
Gyeol's Uncle, please pretend you don't know me either...

808
00:52:15,418 --> 00:52:16,888
if we ever happen to meet again.

809
00:52:32,708 --> 00:52:33,708
Gyu Rim.

810
00:52:37,408 --> 00:52:38,408
Where's Gyeol?

811
00:52:39,508 --> 00:52:40,708
I saw him,

812
00:52:41,078 --> 00:52:42,318
but he went to Mr. Kim Mu Jin's place.

813
00:52:44,148 --> 00:52:46,448
Gyu Seo told me about Mr. Kim Mu Jin.

814
00:52:47,248 --> 00:52:48,258
Anyway,

815
00:52:48,688 --> 00:52:50,258
Gyeol's teacher said that...

816
00:52:50,888 --> 00:52:52,858
if there's someone Gyeol feels he can lean on,

817
00:52:52,928 --> 00:52:54,228
we should just let him.

818
00:52:58,468 --> 00:52:59,698
Who is Gyeol, really?

819
00:53:00,598 --> 00:53:02,038
Is he really not your son?

820
00:53:02,798 --> 00:53:04,068
Then why did you raise him?

821
00:53:05,268 --> 00:53:06,268
Leave.

822
00:53:06,408 --> 00:53:09,938
I respect your privacy, and us living our own lives is fine,

823
00:53:10,478 --> 00:53:11,878
but we're still family.

824
00:53:12,848 --> 00:53:14,108
Whose son Gyeol is,

825
00:53:14,178 --> 00:53:16,278
why you raised a child that isn't yours,

826
00:53:17,048 --> 00:53:18,488
shouldn't you at least be able to tell me that?

827
00:53:22,288 --> 00:53:24,458
Gyeol is my son, Gyu Oh.

828
00:53:25,858 --> 00:53:27,328
No matter what happens,

829
00:53:28,398 --> 00:53:29,428
he is my son.

830
00:53:36,938 --> 00:53:37,938
Gyeol.

831
00:53:43,138 --> 00:53:44,348
What are you doing out here?

832
00:53:45,608 --> 00:53:47,878
Why did you leave me behind?

833
00:53:58,628 --> 00:54:01,758
Do you think I'm a baby?

834
00:54:03,098 --> 00:54:04,768
That doesn't mean I can give you coffee.

835
00:54:13,868 --> 00:54:16,008
Did you come straight here without going home?

836
00:54:16,438 --> 00:54:17,438
Yes.

837
00:54:18,548 --> 00:54:20,878
Did you tell your mom you were coming to see me?

838
00:54:21,148 --> 00:54:22,848
My uncle probably told her.

839
00:54:23,648 --> 00:54:24,648
Oh, really?

840
00:54:25,348 --> 00:54:26,448
Well, that's good.

841
00:54:27,448 --> 00:54:28,858
Am I bothering you?

842
00:54:29,858 --> 00:54:32,558
No. Hey, what kind of question is that?

843
00:54:33,588 --> 00:54:34,928
But it can't be helped.

844
00:54:35,428 --> 00:54:39,398
I have nowhere else to go but here.

845
00:54:39,898 --> 00:54:41,668
Until I find my birth mom.

846
00:54:43,968 --> 00:54:45,338
No matter what anyone says,

847
00:54:45,338 --> 00:54:47,238
your mom always said you were her biological son.

848
00:54:48,678 --> 00:54:53,348
But no one saw my mom give birth to me.

849
00:55:03,218 --> 00:55:04,218
Mister.

850
00:55:05,058 --> 00:55:06,058
Yes?

851
00:55:07,058 --> 00:55:08,258
Instead of milk,

852
00:55:09,228 --> 00:55:10,958
could I get something to eat?

853
00:55:11,568 --> 00:55:13,968
You must be hungry. I'll make you something right away.

854
00:55:14,028 --> 00:55:15,038
What do you want to eat?

855
00:55:15,798 --> 00:55:17,198
Kimchi fried rice.

856
00:55:19,638 --> 00:55:20,638
Hey,

857
00:55:20,768 --> 00:55:22,438
Han Gyeol, you really are your mom's son.

858
00:55:29,518 --> 00:55:31,418
(Geumje Police Station)

859
00:55:31,488 --> 00:55:33,918
Oh, Heung Sik.

860
00:55:34,918 --> 00:55:36,758
Why did you agree to a settlement?

861
00:55:37,118 --> 00:55:39,058
I didn't do anything wrong.

862
00:55:39,888 --> 00:55:41,958
What do you mean you did nothing wrong?

863
00:55:42,498 --> 00:55:43,998
After what you did to that person,

864
00:55:44,058 --> 00:55:47,098
- you did nothing wrong? - Hey, that hurts.

865
00:55:48,168 --> 00:55:49,268
How much did you settle for?

866
00:55:49,338 --> 00:55:52,908
It cost a fortune. Now what?

867
00:55:53,438 --> 00:55:56,708
That's it. Give me that hand of yours...

868
00:55:56,978 --> 00:55:58,548
- so you don't use it recklessly. - Seriously, what gives?

869
00:55:58,608 --> 00:56:00,778
I need to teach that hand of yours a lesson.

870
00:56:02,748 --> 00:56:04,048
Did you tell Gyu Rim?

871
00:56:05,118 --> 00:56:07,148
We have to make sure Gyu Rim never finds out.

872
00:56:07,888 --> 00:56:11,158
Are you in any position to be worrying about her family?

873
00:56:11,528 --> 00:56:14,528
Whose fault is it that we're in this mess?

874
00:56:16,028 --> 00:56:17,558
I don't care about tenant protection.

875
00:56:17,558 --> 00:56:19,498
I'm kicking her family out now,

876
00:56:19,568 --> 00:56:22,168
- and don't you try to stop me. - I dare you to kick them out.

877
00:56:22,738 --> 00:56:26,808
The shared bathroom broke because of your mom's poop.

878
00:56:26,938 --> 00:56:30,778
- I'll post it for everyone to see. - You're unbelievable.

879
00:56:31,478 --> 00:56:33,248
Don't you have a conscience?

880
00:56:33,308 --> 00:56:35,018
My conscience won't let me pretend I don't...

881
00:56:35,578 --> 00:56:36,778
What do you want?

882
00:56:36,978 --> 00:56:38,948
Truth and apology.

883
00:56:40,418 --> 00:56:43,088
Truth and apology, my foot.

884
00:56:44,058 --> 00:56:45,888
I can't believe I gave birth to a snitch...

885
00:56:45,958 --> 00:56:48,128
and ate seaweed soup.

886
00:56:50,758 --> 00:56:53,368
I'll confess that I was the one who did it,

887
00:56:53,598 --> 00:56:55,598
and I'll pay for all the repairs,

888
00:56:56,338 --> 00:56:59,108
so don't you dare kick Gyu Rim's family out.

889
00:57:00,068 --> 00:57:01,578
Fine.

890
00:57:02,108 --> 00:57:04,508
Go ahead, burn the whole place down.

891
00:57:05,208 --> 00:57:06,208
It said if you're involved with someone...

892
00:57:06,278 --> 00:57:07,278
born in February in the Year of the Pig,

893
00:57:07,348 --> 00:57:10,548
all heck will break loose. Right.

894
00:57:10,618 --> 00:57:12,818
Go ahead, burn the whole place down.

895
00:57:12,888 --> 00:57:14,588
What are you talking about?

896
00:57:14,788 --> 00:57:16,288
Who was born in February of the Year of the Pig?

897
00:57:24,398 --> 00:57:25,828
That bastard, Jo Heung Sik.

898
00:57:25,898 --> 00:57:27,528
Everyone told me to be careful around him.

899
00:57:27,768 --> 00:57:29,068
He can't stand to see others do well,

900
00:57:29,138 --> 00:57:30,368
and he gets so jealous.

901
00:57:30,798 --> 00:57:32,638
He's a notorious couple-breaker in our circle.

902
00:57:32,708 --> 00:57:34,408
They even told me not to associate with him.

903
00:57:34,468 --> 00:57:35,508
Darn it.

904
00:57:36,278 --> 00:57:38,608
Am I crazy? Am I out of my mind?

905
00:57:38,948 --> 00:57:40,908
The woman I'm going to marry is less than 3m away,

906
00:57:40,978 --> 00:57:43,418
so why would I kiss a stranger?

907
00:57:46,848 --> 00:57:48,518
Sung Wook, you can't chew apples, can you?

908
00:57:52,428 --> 00:57:54,088
Gyu Young, you're the only one for me.

909
00:57:54,328 --> 00:57:55,398
Really.

910
00:57:56,228 --> 00:57:57,998
What do I have to do for you to believe that I'm innocent?

911
00:57:58,368 --> 00:58:00,428
Should I just drop dead right here in front of you?

912
00:58:01,568 --> 00:58:04,238
Why would you die? Just don't do it again.

913
00:58:05,568 --> 00:58:06,868
You don't believe me.

914
00:58:07,908 --> 00:58:09,008
You can't believe me.

915
00:58:10,638 --> 00:58:11,908
If that's all the faith you have in me,

916
00:58:11,978 --> 00:58:12,978
then let's just call it off.

917
00:58:13,578 --> 00:58:15,278
Let's call the whole thing off.

918
00:58:16,848 --> 00:58:17,878
What is this?

919
00:58:21,088 --> 00:58:23,388
Is she crazy? Darn it.

920
00:58:26,688 --> 00:58:29,628
Gyu Young...

921
00:58:30,128 --> 00:58:31,368
We're not having a wedding.

922
00:58:37,438 --> 00:58:38,538
I was wrong.

923
00:58:38,838 --> 00:58:40,438
I was so wrong.

924
00:58:40,938 --> 00:58:42,108
No, listen, this...

925
00:58:42,478 --> 00:58:44,008
I don't even remember this happening.

926
00:58:44,078 --> 00:58:45,608
My friends threw me a bachelor party,

927
00:58:45,678 --> 00:58:47,048
and they kept making me drink.

928
00:58:47,108 --> 00:58:49,618
Let's skip the ceremony and just take pictures.

929
00:58:50,418 --> 00:58:51,948
In a wedding dress and tuxedo.

930
00:58:52,618 --> 00:58:53,618
What?

931
00:58:55,618 --> 00:58:58,958
So does that mean you'll marry me?

932
00:58:59,488 --> 00:59:02,098
We'll tell the guests we've decided to donate the wedding money...

933
00:59:02,158 --> 00:59:03,458
and say it in style.

934
00:59:10,338 --> 00:59:12,808
Gyu Young, you really are amazing...

935
00:59:13,538 --> 00:59:15,408
Once the community service center opens tomorrow,

936
00:59:15,478 --> 00:59:16,508
we're going to register our marriage.

937
00:59:16,708 --> 00:59:17,808
You just have to sign it.

938
00:59:18,148 --> 00:59:19,348
I'll go by myself.

939
00:59:25,948 --> 00:59:27,188
If you want to have an affair,

940
00:59:27,248 --> 00:59:29,088
go ahead whenever you want without worrying about me.

941
00:59:30,858 --> 00:59:32,388
Then I won't have to worry about you...

942
00:59:32,458 --> 00:59:35,028
and can have an affair too. So, we're good, right?

943
00:59:36,528 --> 00:59:38,368
I was always curious what it's like to have a marriage for show.

944
00:59:38,598 --> 00:59:39,698
Let's give it a try.

945
00:59:40,868 --> 00:59:42,168
It'll be a lot of fun.

946
01:00:11,668 --> 01:00:14,568
(Here Lies My Hope)

947
01:00:18,568 --> 01:00:20,238
(Here Lies My Hope)

948
01:00:24,038 --> 01:00:26,548
(Incoming Call)

949
01:00:28,578 --> 01:00:29,678
It's Hye Jeong.

950
01:00:30,548 --> 01:00:31,548
Gyu Rim.

951
01:00:34,718 --> 01:00:36,388
No matter how much I thought about it,

952
01:00:37,088 --> 01:00:39,658
you're the only person I could think of.

953
01:00:40,758 --> 01:00:44,998
Something's come up for me, and I just can't raise my baby.

954
01:00:45,928 --> 01:00:48,938
I'd be so grateful if you could raise him along with your child,

955
01:00:49,638 --> 01:00:52,468
but if you can't, please take him to an orphanage for me.

956
01:00:54,208 --> 01:00:56,578
I'm so sorry. Please do this for me, Gyu Rim.

957
01:00:58,448 --> 01:01:01,678
(Baby Box)

958
01:01:34,478 --> 01:01:35,718
(Baby Box)

959
01:01:49,428 --> 01:01:51,768
(Baby Box)

960
01:01:53,328 --> 01:01:55,168
She's abandoning you...

961
01:01:58,038 --> 01:02:00,138
How can you not even cry?

962
01:02:04,508 --> 01:02:05,948
You're breaking my heart.

963
01:02:08,618 --> 01:02:09,948
Oh, my.

964
01:02:19,658 --> 01:02:23,328
There we go. Okay, all done.

965
01:02:24,528 --> 01:02:26,898
Come on, Han Gyeol. You can do it.

966
01:02:27,368 --> 01:02:29,998
Oh, you can roll over.

967
01:02:30,298 --> 01:02:31,668
Go, Han Gyeol.

968
01:02:32,508 --> 01:02:34,438
Oh, did you roll over?

969
01:02:35,608 --> 01:02:36,908
Lemon.

970
01:02:41,918 --> 01:02:43,078
Mom.

971
01:02:44,048 --> 01:02:45,318
Mom?

972
01:02:45,948 --> 01:02:47,848
Did you just say Mom?

973
01:02:55,498 --> 01:02:56,498
I'm Mom.

974
01:02:59,768 --> 01:03:01,568
I'm your mom. I'm Gyeol's Mom.

975
01:03:07,608 --> 01:03:09,008
Where are you going?

976
01:03:34,828 --> 01:03:37,938
I heard Gyeol is with you.

977
01:03:39,438 --> 01:03:41,708
I was actually just about to call you.

978
01:03:45,808 --> 01:03:47,048
Again,

979
01:03:47,948 --> 01:03:49,148
I am so sorry.

980
01:03:49,378 --> 01:03:51,218
I'm about to wash Gyeol up and put him to bed.

981
01:03:53,748 --> 01:03:54,888
I'm so sorry.

982
01:03:56,118 --> 01:03:57,458
I'm truly sorry.

983
01:03:59,058 --> 01:04:00,188
Have you been crying?

984
01:04:09,538 --> 01:04:10,698
No.

985
01:04:12,338 --> 01:04:13,508
Where are you right now?

986
01:04:16,638 --> 01:04:17,738
Where are you?

987
01:04:22,748 --> 01:04:23,848
I'm sorry.

988
01:04:24,018 --> 01:04:25,748
Well, as for Gyeol,

989
01:04:26,648 --> 01:04:30,088
my brother is going to pick him up tomorrow morning.

990
01:04:30,818 --> 01:04:32,628
If you could just send me the address...

991
01:04:32,988 --> 01:04:34,188
Gyu Rim, where are you?

992
01:04:40,768 --> 01:04:41,968
I'm coming to you now.

993
01:04:47,738 --> 01:04:50,278
I'm on my way to you. Where are you?

994
01:05:31,048 --> 01:05:33,048
(Love on the Menu)

995
01:05:33,318 --> 01:05:36,458
Your mom loves you so much. Why do you make her so upset?

996
01:05:36,518 --> 01:05:38,488
I don't know why, but I just keep getting angry.

997
01:05:38,558 --> 01:05:40,988
I went to the community center and registered our marriage.

998
01:05:41,058 --> 01:05:42,958
We didn't just agree to date. We're dating now.

999
01:05:43,098 --> 01:05:44,228
Today is our first day.

1000
01:05:44,298 --> 01:05:46,468
Let's stop playing games.

1001
01:05:46,468 --> 01:05:47,768
You said you didn't care who it was.

1002
01:05:47,828 --> 01:05:49,298
You know I like your mom, right?

1003
01:05:49,368 --> 01:05:52,208
- When did you start liking her? - Before you were born.

1004
01:05:52,268 --> 01:05:53,438
I'm going to tell him the truth.

1005
01:05:53,508 --> 01:05:57,038
- But I'm a little scared. - I can wait all night.

1006
01:05:57,538 --> 01:05:59,648
Take your time.

